	(text "H1 to H4: #8-32 screws into the two brain mount brackets (brainMount-frontSlant left and right).\nHole centres 93.92 mm (3.6976 in) left to right, 50.80 mm (2.000 in) top to bottom.\n4.5 mm non-plated holes, slightly larger than the 0.175 in (4.45 mm) bracket holes. Not tied to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 116.84 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e9093712-bbe7-4636-a4c3-48bfe22540f4"))
